      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778958786631,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SSH Protocol (Secure shell protocol)\n- it helps user to give the secure way to login into some machine in unsecure network \n- uses some cryptography techniques to gives security\n- some set of rules are defined for particular type of communications\n- login to the remote machine and execute some commands over there (practical gonna do)\n- login to git/github using ssh protocol\n- ssh client (process running on our machine capable of making ssh request)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SSH Protocol (Secure shell protocol)\n- it helps user to give the secure way to login into some machine in unsecure network \n- uses some cryptography techniques to gives security\n- some set of rules are defined for particular type of communications\n- login to the remote machine and execute some commands over there (practical gonna do)\n- login to git/github using ssh protocol\n- ssh client (process running on our machine capable of making ssh request)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
