      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778959745793,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is hyper text? \n- Hypertext is digital text that contains clickable links, allowing \n   readers to jump instantly to other sections of the document \n   or to entirely different web pages",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is hyper text? \n- Hypertext is digital text that contains clickable links, allowing \n   readers to jump instantly to other sections of the document \n   or to entirely different web pages",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0cWbeEFufPxYUp3216ZqN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 572.7999877929688,
      "y": 1373.7999725341797,
      "width": 1002.0394287109375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 757665474,
      "version": 256,
      "versionNonce": 1510997762,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1778960305070,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- When we make an HTTP request, then there are a lot of components involved that we have to send\n  When we receive an HTTP response then also we have a lot of components received from the server \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
