      "text": "DELETE \nhttp://ubereats.com/order -> we want to delete all the orders\n\nGET\nhttp://ubereats.com/orders -> fetch all the orders\n\nGET\nhttp://ubereats.com/orders/1 -> fetch data of the order uniquely represented\n                                           by order id 1\n\nDELETE\nhttp://ubereats.com/orders/1 -> delete order with orderid 1 \n",
